    <task id="Id_c5978f74-78b8-4d81-8856-74f5a13e3364" name="5.3.7 Compile the delivery team's tender response">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Consolidar todas as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es necess&amp;aacute;rias para responder ao convite de licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o garantindo que contenha o BEP (pr&amp;eacute;-contratual); a compet&amp;ecirc;ncia e capacidade da equipe de entrega; a proposta do plano de mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o; e a gest&amp;atilde;o de riscos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
